## Title: Dufforth Tweaks Helper
## Notes: Gathering, disenchanting and crafting help. Keeps herb and ore icons on the minimap, swaps tracking, says in item tooltips whether to disenchant, sell on the auction house or sell to a vendor, disenchants BoE gear one click at a time, recommends gear worth crafting to disenchant, and keeps a one-button warrior macro up to date.
